        {
          "id": 719305883,
          "type": "DiscussionNote",
          "body": "I put a capture in the issue.\nJust, if it's easier to use the openssl default PSK identity:\n\n[rfc9146_port_5684.pcapng.gz](/uploads/f0ccde4767bb5b10b1235a6f92d28ee0/rfc9146_port_5684.pcapng.gz)\n\nWith 73656372657450534b as Pre-Shared Key, the application records are decode, the tls_cid records not.\n\n```\njava -jar target/cf-client-3.0.0-RC2.jar --identity=Client_identity --secret=secretPSK  --cid-length=0 coaps://californium.eclipseprojects.io:5684 -m GET\n```",
