        {
          "id": 719320621,
          "type": "DiscussionNote",
          "body": "@alagoutte I made this calculation for `connection_id` 54:\n```\n        if (is_cid) {\n            lengths[1] = 22 + 1 + cidl; /* cid length (1 byte) + cid (cidl bytes)*/\n        }\n```\n```\n    if (is_cid) { /* if connection ID */\n        guchar aad[23+DTLS_MAX_CID_LENGTH];\n        guint aad_len = 23 + cidl;\n        memset(aad, 0xFF, 8);               /* seq_num_placeholder */\n        aad[8] = ct;                        /* TLSCompressed.type */\n        aad[9] = cidl;                      /* cid_length */\n        aad[10] = ct;                       /* TLSCompressed.type */\n        phton16(aad + 11, record_version);  /* TLSCompressed.version */\n        phton64(aad + 13, decoder->seq);    /* record sequence number */\n        phton16(aad + 13, decoder->epoch);  /* DTLS 1.2 includes epoch. */\n        memcpy(aad + 21, cid, cidl);        /* cid */\n        phton16(aad + 21 + cidl, ciphertext_len);  /* TLSCompressed.length */\n        ssl_print_data(\"AAD\", aad, aad_len);\n```",
          "author": {
            "id": 4753670,
            "username": "stigbjorlykke",
            "public_email": "",
            "name": "Stig Bjørlykke",
            "state": "active",
            "locked": false,
            "avatar_url": "https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/905aafc6b50e246885f5ea9273a9dc4f22e2658b71f9a1b551b797082bec3f80?s=80&d=identicon",
            "web_url": "https://gitlab.com/stigbjorlykke"
          },
          "created_at": "2021-10-31T10:49:10.802Z",
          "updated_at": "2021-10-31T10:49:10.802Z",
